#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House1/scripts.inc:43
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House1_Text_YouWillTradeWontYou"
msgid ""
"Wrooooaaar! I need it!\n"
"I have to get me a {STR_VAR_1}!\l"
"I'll do anything for it!\p"
"…Uh… Did you hear that?\n"
"My shout from the bottom of my heart?\p"
"Having heard that, you will trade\n"
"your {STR_VAR_1} for my {STR_VAR_2},\l"
"won't you?$"
msgstr ""
"呜哦哦哦哦！我想要！我一定要得到\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}！为了它我什么都愿意做！\p"
"……呃……你听到了吗？\n"
"我发自内心的呐喊？\p"
"既然听到了，你会用你的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"来换我的{STR_VAR_2}吧？$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House1/scripts.inc:53
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House1_Text_MonYouTakeCare"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah, right on!\p"
"{STR_VAR_1}, welcome!\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}, you take care!$"
msgstr ""
"哦耶，太棒啦！\p"
"{STR_VAR_1}，欢迎你！\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}，多保重哦！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House1/scripts.inc:58
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House1_Text_ThisIsntAMon"
msgid ""
"Uh, no, I don't think so.\n"
"That isn't a {STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"呃，不对，我觉得不是。\n"
"这不是{STR_VAR_1}啊。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House1/scripts.inc:62
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House1_Text_YouWontTradeMe"
msgid ""
"No? You won't trade me?\n"
"Even after I bared my heart to you?$"
msgstr ""
"不行？你不跟我换吗？\n"
"我都把真心话告诉你了耶？$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House1/scripts.inc:66
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House1_Text_GoingToMakeVolbeatStrong"
msgid ""
"I'm going to make VOLBEAT super\n"
"strong from this moment on!\p"
"I hope you do the same with PLUSLE!$"
msgstr ""
"从现在起，我要把电萤虫培养得超级强！\p"
"希望你也好好培养正电拍拍哦！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House1/scripts.inc:71
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House1_Text_TradingMemoriesWithOthers"
msgid ""
"Trading POKéMON with others…\p"
"It's as if you're trading your own\n"
"memories with other people.$"
msgstr ""
"和别人交换宝可梦……\p"
"就好像在和别人交换自己的回忆一样。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House1/scripts.inc:76
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House1_Text_Zigzagoon"
msgid "ZIGZAGOON: Gumomoh?$"
msgstr "蛇纹熊：咕呣呣？$"
